{"id":"aa74c64e0d85e60f","group":"88","path":"88/88-fact-church-turing-thesis.md","title":"fact-church-turing-thesis — Formal Equivalence Supporting Church-Turing","display":"fact-church-turing-thesis — Formal Equivalence Supporting Church-Turing","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-fact-church-turing-thesis","aliases":["88-fact-church-turing-thesis"],"display":"fact-church-turing-thesis — Formal Equivalence Supporting Church-Turing","depends_on":["[[88-df-church-turing-thesis]]","[[88-df-computable-function]]","[[88-df-mu-recursive]]","[[88-df-partial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-fact-church-turing-thesis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-fact-church-turing-thesis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-church-turing-thesis — Formal Equivalence Supporting Church-Turing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"00bd6f946aa1721c\" href=\"?note=00bd6f946aa1721c\" title=\"88-df-church-turing-thesis\">88-df-church-turing-thesis</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bf4e721d88316525\" href=\"?note=bf4e721d88316525\" title=\"88-df-mu-recursive\">88-df-mu-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d585cbf989199162\" href=\"?note=d585cbf989199162\" title=\"88-df-partial-function\">88-df-partial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> (arity)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> (candidate partial number-theoretic function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\\)</span> (partial-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d585cbf989199162\" href=\"?note=d585cbf989199162\" title=\"88-df-partial-function\">88-df-partial-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_k(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_k(f)\\)</span> (Turing-computability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MuRec}_k(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{MuRec}_k(f)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>-recursive predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bf4e721d88316525\" href=\"?note=bf4e721d88316525\" title=\"88-df-mu-recursive\">88-df-mu-recursive</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}church\\text{-}turing\\text{-}thesis}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\n\\to\n(\\mathrm{Comp}_k(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MuRec}_k(f))\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}church\\text{-}turing\\text{-}thesis}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\n\\to\n(\\mathrm{Comp}_k(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MuRec}_k(f))\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>这里断言的是两个精确定义的数学模型外延等价，而不是把前理论的\n“有效可计算”谓词化后冒充已证明事实。</li>\n<li>该等价为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"00bd6f946aa1721c\" href=\"?note=00bd6f946aa1721c\" title=\"88-df-church-turing-thesis\">88-df-church-turing-thesis</a> 中的元理论论题提供数学证据，\n但不构成对论题本身的形式证明。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-church-turing-thesis","status":"resolved","id":"00bd6f946aa1721c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-church-turing-thesis]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-computable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-mu-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"bf4e721d88316525","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-mu-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"d585cbf989199162","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"d585cbf989199162","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialFunction}$ (partial-function predicate, see [[88-df-partial-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}_k(f)$ (Turing-computability predicate, see [[88-df-computable-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-mu-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"bf4e721d88316525","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MuRec}_k(f)$ ($\\mu$-recursive predicate, see [[88-df-mu-recursive]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-church-turing-thesis","status":"resolved","id":"00bd6f946aa1721c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"该等价为 [[88-df-church-turing-thesis]] 中的元理论论题提供数学证据，\n但不构成对论题本身的形式证明。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}_k(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MuRec}_k(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}church\\text{-}turing\\text{-}thesis}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\n\\to\n(\\mathrm{Comp}_k(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MuRec}_k(f))\n\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1368,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["00bd6f946aa1721c","64279ecae5246baf","bf4e721d88316525","d585cbf989199162"]}